# The fire rain's cost (reports/content/remaster/magic-fire/rain.md): the rain from 18 m aside at night over the meadow
# east of the tavern at its fullest - the gobs and their trails, the landings and the fires on the grass - from 1.2 s
# to 6.2 s after the cast. Compare sets with scripts/perf-content.sh A B firerain. Animated draws are hidden on both
# sides.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 22 0
cadence normal
overlay off
ui off
view full
view hide animated morph
goto NW_TAVERNE_TROLLAREA_03
clear 3000
stats mana 3000 circle 6
equip ItRu_Firerain
tap spell
# Ten real seconds after the teleport for loading and native simulation.
wait 10000
set time 22 0
watch player
cam follow 1800 450 70
wait 2000
cam hold
wait 1000
press action
wait 1500
press forward
wait 300
release forward
wait 300
release action
wait 600
perf sample perf-firerain/view-1
wait 5000
perf stop
